Part 1 steps 1–8 (AWS gateway ke 4 modules).
Part 2 steps 1–4, ek poora static pipeline run trace karo.
Part 2 step 6 (dynamic), ye sabse bada chunk hai.
Steps 5, 7, 8, 9.
